{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ballad</strong> is a\u00a0musical 3D adventure  game ! <br><br>Embark on this cosy journey where you\u00a0will play as Key, a Kalimba player bard and this instrument will be your only tool in order to progress in this game. <br>As a bard, you resolve all dangers by the magic of music, so you don't need HP, or game over, you are free to enjoy your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometime you will have to understand the world around you and echoes its melodies, sometime you will have to use the songs you've learnt in order to explore deeper.<br>Anyway you will always be free to jam or enjoy playing your instrument under a coconut tree and chill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>You will be able to call, interact, sooth the people of the island and much more thanks to your musical instrument, try to know a bit more about the different biomes villagers and their musical lifestyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the 12 island instruments and share your melodies !<br><br><i>The game is designed to be played with a controller but the keyboard is also supported.</i><br><i>You can also play with your MIDI Keyboard !</i> <br> <br>Controls :<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528200/extras/1d7b7ba8d65042c8c41850422ba4a0d6.avif?t=1770827981\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3528200?t=1770827981","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3528200?t=1770827981","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528200/14bb2df928bde314fe310163185bc6b9e105293a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770827981","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528200/14bb2df928bde314fe310163185bc6b9e1